#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To make this package really useful, install <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-"
"portal\"/>, <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gtk\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\""
" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gnome\"/> (if running a GNOME desktop "
"environment), and <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-lxqt\"/>"
" (if running a LXQt desktop environment).  They are not needed if only using"
" this package to satisfy a build dependency."
msgstr ""
"Para tornar esse pacote realmente útil, instale <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-"
"portal\"/>, <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gtk\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\""
" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gnome\"/> (se executar um ambiente de área de "
"trabalho GNOME) e <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-lxqt\"/>"
" (se executar um ambiente de área de trabalho LXQt). Eles não são "
"necessários se usar esse pacote somente para satisfazer uma dependência de "
"construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (for documentation), <xref linkend=\"python-"
"dbusmock\"/> and <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> (for testing), <xref "
"linkend=\"qt6\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"vala\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (para documentação), <xref linkend=\"python-"
"dbusmock\"/> e <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> (para testagem), <xref "
"linkend=\"qt6\"/> e <xref linkend=\"vala\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libportal"
msgstr "Instalação do libportal"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If a previous version of libportal is installed, move the headers out of the"
" way so that later packages do not encounter conflicts (as the <systemitem "
"role=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Se uma versão anterior do \"libportal\" estiver instalada, [então] mova os "
"cabeçalhos para fora do caminho, de forma que os pacotes posteriores não "
"encontrem conflitos (como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"role=\"username\">root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>if [ -e /usr/include/libportal ]; then\n"
"    rm -rf /usr/include/libportal.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"    mv -vf /usr/include/libportal{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>if [ -e /usr/include/libportal ]; then\n"
"   rm -rf /usr/include/libportal.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"   mv -vf /usr/include/libportal{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"

#.  BLFS Ticket #21429
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "First, apply a patch to fix building against Qt 6.9 and later:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique um remendo para corrigir construção contra Qt 6.9 e "
"posteriores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../libportal-&libportal-"
"version;-qt6.9_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../libportal-&libportal-"
"version;-qt6.9_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libportal</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>libportal</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D vapi=false       \\\n"
"            -D docs=false       \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D vapi=false       \\\n"
"            -D docs=false       \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:158
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i \"/output/s/-1/-&libportal-version;/\" ../doc/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=true                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i \"/output/s/-1/-&libportal-version;/\" ../doc/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=true                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. Note that "
"additional <filename>dbus-daemon</filename> processes may need to be killed "
"after the tests are run."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Observe que"
" processos adicionais <filename>dbus-daemon</filename> possivelmente "
"precisem ser eliminados depois que os testes forem executados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libportal.xml:172
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

